�"Ola osa eikhe pei ston epitheorete etan aletheia, alla sumbainei kai e aletheia na einai to megalutero psema.
Giati khoris na distasei, pege ste gonia tou mpoulbar Sain-Misel kai perimene ena leophoreio pou pegaine sto stathmo Gkar nte Luon; To ekane khoris na skephtei. Oute mia stigme den eikhe pei na kanei auto e to allo.
Mepos arkhize epitelous e zoe; Den exere. Phobotan na thesei ston eauto tou ten erotese. Den exere pou pegaine, oute ti tha ekane. Eikhe phugei. Den uperkhe pleon tipota piso tou. Den uperkhe akome tipota mprosta tou. Briskotan aplos mesa sto khoro.
Milouse khoris n' anoigei to stoma, giati den uperkhe logos. Diegiotan ten ateleiote kopose tou pou den etan e kopose tou taxidiou mesa s' ena bagoni, alla aute tou megalou taxidiou tou ospou na androthei."
Sta sarantaokto tou khronia, krupha apogoeteumenos apo ten uparxe tou, o Normper Mont apophasizei na egkataleipsei tous pantes kai ta panta, te gunaika tou Terez, ta paidia tou, ten epikheirese me tis exagoges pou diaterouse.
Dialegei te zoe tou periplanomenou, te zoe tou perithoriou kai tes phtokheias, kai e epiloge aute ton phernei suntoma se ena metrio xenodokheio tes Massalias. Ekei gnorizei te Zuli, mia neare dustukhismene gunaika pou tha ton apotrepsei apo ten autoktonia. Mesa apo ten pio aproblepte poreia, o kurios Mont tha xanabrei to dromo pou ton odegei pros tous allous kai pros te neanike tou uparxe.
Kanena allo muthistorema den prospherei toso kharakteristike eikona gia to sumpan tou Zorz Simenon, gia ten elxe pou askoun pano tou oi pio anaimikes phainomenika uparxeis, oi khoroi pou krubontai sto emiphos, ta perithoria tes koinonias. Den uparkhei eroas perissotero idiomorphos kai musteriodes apo ton kurio Mont, prosopo kathemerino pou anakaluptei apo ta bathe tes psukhes tou ton tropo na xanagennethei kai na kataktesei ten "psukhre" nephalioteta, diokhnontas ta phantasmata kai tis skies pou ton stoikheionan."�	
�	- Istoriko Muthistorema Epistemonikes Phantasias -
O Ioannes Karatzas etan logios, suntrophos tou Rega (Pheraiou) Belestinle kai katagotan apo te Leukosia tes Kuprou. Ta istorika stoikheia pou uparkhoun gia ton Karatza xekinoun to 1790 ste Bienne, otan autos etan ede 23 eton. Gia ten proegoumene tou zoe oi istorikoi ereunetes den ekhoun katapherei na entopisoun to paramikro. Les kai emphanisteke apo to pouthena...
E istoria thelei ton Ioanne Karatza na ekteleitai apo tous Tourkous, mazi me ton Rega kai exi allous epanastates, to 1798, ston purgo Nempoiza sto Beligradi. Mono pou ta gegonota, isos, na men sunebesan etsi akribos ...
As aphesoume, omos, ton idio ton Karatza na mas aphegethei, mesa apo to agnosto autobiographiko tou keimeno, aute ten apisteute istoria pou xekina apo to mellon kai teleionei sto parelthon.
(Semeiose: To keimeno pou akolouthei apotelei pisto antigrapho kheirographou pou anakaluphteke prosphata, se krupte sketes sto Agio Oros. Oi periergoi iskhurismoi tou exetazontai apo omada epistemonon diaphoron eidikoteton, e opoia apoteleitai apo istorikous, graphologous kai kbantikous phusikous).
To keimeno to Ioanne Karatza arkhizei os exes:
<>
Ioannes Karatzas"�
�"Treis emigumnoi antres etan paloukomenoi pano se muterous passalous pou sterizontan stis phardies sanides mias xulines exedras. Ta tentomena kheria tous eikhan dethei se orizonties dokous pou skhematizan enan stauro me kathe passalo, ta kouremena kephalia tous eikhan trabekhtei pros ta piso me ena skoini. Sto arrosto phos tou eliou ta diastreblomena mele kai ta paramorphomena tous prosopa etan akineta..." To proto miso tou 9ou aiona e erida tes Eikonomakhias ekhei dikhasei gia deutere phora te buzantine koinonia, eno oi sunekheis epidromes ton Arabon ste Mikra Asia ekhoun apostatheropoiesei to kratos. Maios tou 832: O autokratoras stelnei ton protospathario Leonta epikephales mias presbeias ston khaliphe tes Bagdates gia na diapragmateuthei eirene sten Anatole. O presbeutes kai e sunodeia tou phtanoun sten Kaisareia tes Kappadokias, teleutaio stathmo prin apo ta sunora. Kato apo ten ereme epiphaneia, ta pragmata briskontai se anabrasmo. Arabes kataskopoi proetoimazoun mia exegerse, kalogeroi upothalpoun ten airese tes Eikonolatrias, somatemporoi kleboun neares gunaikes gia ta sklabopazara tes Surias. O stratiotikos dioiketes phainetai pos ekhei khasei ton elegkho tes poles. O apotropaios phonos tes dekatriakhrones kores tou dikaste exo apo ta teikhe ton anagkazei na zetesei te boetheia tou presbeute. O protospatharios Leon zouse mekhri ekeine te stigme ten esukhe zoe enos kratikou axiomatoukhou. Anupantros, ligo apomakros, diabazei erotika muthistoremata kai paizei mousike me ena ebenino laouto. Tora, anamesa stous stratones, ta kapeleia kai ta porneia tes Kaisareias, prepei na lusei protognora gi' auton egklemata kai brisketai antimetopos me ton eauto tou kai to parelthon tou."�
�Otan o Mpani, gios megistana ton petrelaion -kai deinou ekmetalleute tes kratikes diaphthoras gia ten exoruxe tous-, gnorizei ton Kaliphornezo proletario Pol, kai erkhetai se epaphe me tis idees kai tous agones tou ergatikou kinematos, e rexe pou prokuptei anamesa s' auton kai ton patera tou tha purodotesei mia isobia anazetese tes aletheias kai tes dikaiosunes.
Mesa apo skandala ki epanastaseis, skenes astikes truphelotetas kai proletariakes makhes ap' opou parelaunoun plethos graphikon kharakteron -megalomaneis ki arguronetoi airesiarkhes, ethika diabromenoi biomekhanoi kai starlet tou Kholigount, apheleis ideologoi kai aboula sphagia tou diabletou ergatikou kinematos kai tes antiphatikes sosialistikes polemikes- o Apton Sinkler plathei mia istoria allote sparakhtike ki allote xekardistike, skiagraphontas, me tropo axekhasto, sto prosopo tou Mpani to prosopo tou sugkhronou anthropou, pou ginetai ermaio katastaseon pou ton xepernoun.
Sto biblio auto basisteke e tainia tou Pol Tomas Anterson, "Tha khuthei aima", pou apephere to brabeio Oskar ston protagoniste tes, Ntaniel Ntei Louis."�
�E erotike skhese tes Eratos kai tou Antrea einai exarkhes adiexode. Ta gegonota pou mesolabesan anamesa tous einai tragika kai ta empodia pou uparkhoun phantazoun anuperbleta teikhe. O Antreas prospathei na kerdisei te khamene piste kai ten agape tes Eratos khresimopoiontas lathos tropous. Aute pali phobatai na paradekhtei ta aisthemata tes ki apophasizei xaphnika na kanei ena megalo bema, mia megale anatrope, pou epereazei te zoe olon tous. Pheugei ki aphenei piso tes ola auta pou ten plegonoun kai den thelei na ta thumatai.
E Thaleia, phile tes kai adelphe tou Antrea, prospathei na boethesei, khoris oi prospatheies tes na ekhoun kapoio apotelesma. Antimetopizei ki aute entones katastaseis ste skhese tes me ton Petro, alla e megale agape pou tous denei tous krata enomenous mekhri ten telike dikaiose.
Krummena mustika, erotes, lathe, psemata, misos kai... thanatos. Dromoi pou khorizoun kai diastauronontai xana, agapes pou antekhoun sto khrono kai dikaionontai."�
�Ti katastrophes mporei na prokalesei e mpananophlouda pou petaxe e mikre Anna ste mese tou dromou; Poios arage tha ten patesei; Mepos enas rodalos zakharoplastes stroumpoulos pou tha ton akolouthoun boethoi zakharoplastes phortomenoi me gluka kai pastes; Mepos enas strategos pou tha kanei parelase kamarotos kai piso tou tha bematizei enas aniketos stratos; E mepos kapoia nuphe glukia san kataIphi me nuphiko ap' to khioni pio leuko pou tha prokhoraei agkaze me to gampro kai piso tes th' akolouthei e gamelia pompe;
Ekeine te kheimoniatike nukhta e Anna metaniomene gia ten praxe tes apophasizei na bgei krupha ap' to spiti tes kai, apsephontas ten kataigida pou mainetai na brei, na mazepsei ten petamene mpananophlouda."�
�E moiraia philia duo andron, me phonto te megale peripeteia tes Aristeras apo te dekaetia tou 50 eos semera.
O Gregores Mikhael epistrephei sto Boukouresti to kalokairi tou 2014, ste duse pia tou biou tou, kai aphenei tis anamneseis na ton parasuroun se ena thuellodes taxidi me apheteria to 1956.
Ekei, sto allote krataio Hotel National, anamesa stous polukairismenous toikhous, tis skies kai ta prosopika tou phantasmata, anagkazetai na erthei antimetopos me tis aletheies, ta psemata kai tis anomologetes enokhes tou.
Ti pege, aletheia, toso lathos kai eidan oloi ta neanika tous oneira na sunthlibontai apo ten exousia; Kai poies oduneres ekplexeis perimenoun auton ton 82khrono antra apo te stigme pou apophasise na skalisei to parelthon;
To Hotel National einai mia istoria-phoros times gia ekeinous pou aphesan na tous parasuroun oi anemoi tes Istorias."�
�Lisbeth Salander, the girl with the dragon tattoo, the brilliant hacker, the obstinate outsider, the volatile seeker of justice for herself and others--even she has never been able to uncover the most telling facts of her traumatic childhood, the secrets that might finally, fully explain her to herself. Now, when she sees a chance to uncover them once and for all, she enlists the help of Mikael Blomkvist, the editor of the muckraking, investigative journal Millennium. And she will let nothing stop her--not the anti-Muslim gang she enrages by rescuing a young woman from their brutality; not the deadly reach from inside the Russian mafia of her long-lost twin sister, Camilla; and not the people who will do anything to keep buried knowledge of a sinister pseudoscientific experiment known only as The Registry. Once again, Lisbeth Salander and Mikael Blomkvist, together, are the fierce heart of a thrilling full-tilt novel that takes on some of the most insidious problems facing the world at this very moment."�
�Ste dekaetia tou '30, o stalinismos diapotizei tis suneideseis ton laon tes D. Europes kai tes ESSD. Omos oi perissoteroi komounistes pisteuoun oti to deleterio etan balsamo. Ligoi suneidetopoiousan pos kati den pegaine kala, pos eikhan kanei lathos. Oi prosboles tes aletheias kai oi endokommatikes prodosies (phainomena pou apotupothekan kathara stis dikes tes Moskhas) diepseusan me tragiko tropo ta oramata oson eikhan ependusei ole tous ten upostase sten upothese tes sosialistikes epanastases. Enas ap' autous etan o Ntoino Phamper, istorikos, egetiko stelekhos tou germanikou KK, kentrikos eroas tou bibliou. Mesa apo te diadrome tou epanastate-stokhaste, o suggrapheas stenei mia megaleiode toikhographia tes Kentrikes Europes kai ton Balkanion, eiskhorei sta aduta tes Komintern kai apokaluptei oti to ergasteri ton mekhanismon pou alloiosan ta anthropistika ideode tes Epanastases den eikhe alle edra apo te megalutere ton abusson: ten anthropine psukhe. Prosopika pathe kai adunamies diaplekontai s' ena meigma ekrektiko, pou tinazei polles zoes ston aera.
Ena aristourgematiko muthistorema pou menei axekhasto ste mneme tou anagnoste."�
�Ksereis kati phile; phile mou agnoste, kollete e philekhthre; Eimai aute pou eimai* plasmene apo astra kai phos, skotadi kai laba* pathos, lathe kai emmones, oneira, kollemata kai strabes* agapo to einai mou opos einai* to apodekhomai pia, den tha allaxo gia kanenan kai tipota - aute einai kai tha einai e zoe mou, mekhri to telos.
Apodekhomai ton allo opos einai, apaito omos na me dekhtoun kai emena opos eimai. Mone mou poreuteka 45 khronia - me mou aploseis kheri gia na me allaxeis. Den tha ginei pote, an ego to epithumo mono tote tha peraso epipedo. Terma oi sumboules, terma ta dethen. It's me, kai opos estrosa tha koimetho..."␀␀�@"␀␀�@"	)\���(@"	)\���(@"	\���(\@"	ffffff@"	��Q��@"	���Q�@"	���Q�@"	ףp=
